0..59 Comment "// Deployments the check refuses before any process starts."
60..62 Comment "//"
63..141 Comment "// A deployment pairs a role\'s requirement with a site\'s offer, and a mismatch"
142..202 Comment "// must stop the deployment rather than the role at arrival."
203..205 Comment "//"
206..283 Comment "// This file is a site and a manifold at once. `far` requires the console and"
284..357 Comment "// a store of strings under `store`. The site lists no console, and binds"
358..431 Comment "// `store` to a store of integers. Placing `far` at it is refused at each"
432..507 Comment "// entry: the console by its name, and `store` naming both types. `nowhere`"
508..585 Comment "// is no world the program declares, so its placement is refused by name. The"
586..661 Comment "// file itself settles, and `gandr check` of it as a deployment refuses all"
662..671 Comment "// three."
672..674 Comment "//"
675..753 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.gandr` — the program, whose `far`"
754..775 Comment "//   requires the row"
776..854 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/deployments/offers.site.gandr` — a site answering it"
855..934 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/cli.rs` — the check refusing all three"
936..963 Comment "// The deployment theories."
